  PSRAM discovery: asking all ten selects for an identity
    CS0  PRESENT  id 0D 5D
    CS1  PRESENT  id 0D 5D
    Y0   PRESENT  id 0D 5D
    Y1   PRESENT  id 0D 5D
    Y2   PRESENT  id 0D 5D
    Y3   PRESENT  id 0D 5D
    Y4   PRESENT  id 0D 5D
    Y5   PRESENT  id 0D 5D
    Y6   absent   id 00 00
    Y7   absent   id 00 00
