  qualifying each: quad first, then single-bit, confirmed over 1024 kB four times
      CS0  quad        edge write  0 read 13, running at write  3 read 18 burst 96 setup  0 ->  8.82 MB/s
      CS1  quad        edge write  0 read 16, running at write  3 read 24 burst 96 setup  0 ->  7.31 MB/s
